{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8e7a8d12add1f489e2ca3fad2ddc5f9412a1f97b7f805ea47f17b6df282999ea", "ja": "（野外ライブが近い。そろそろ演出プランを\n固めないとだけど、さて、どうしようかな……）", "zh": "（户外演唱会临近了。也差不多该确定演出方案了，可是，该怎么办呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1001_050jul", "source_sha256": "73d3d0340c61f27dca679aa009ead59901cc78a73f8594b47451e105ff8571ec", "ja": "おーい、{$P$}！\nあ、いたいた。お疲れさん。", "zh": "喂——{$P$}！\n啊，在这儿呢。辛苦啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dcf39aed368e5e6f68bef4c57213ab13b67e3d1bfb30e118c50de9939497b280", "ja": "ジュリア？　お疲れさま。どうしたんだ？", "zh": "茱莉亚？辛苦了。怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1003_050jul", "source_sha256": "205f1da1498579ecd0a72dba2fd338e87bf4d8db89ec3d24211e636f1dbaa275", "ja": "次のステージ演出、考えてんだろ？　へへっ。\nあたしがすげえアイディア、持って来てやったぜ♪", "zh": "你正在考虑下一场演出的效果吧？嘿嘿。\n我给你带来了一个超棒的点子♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "298638bd0e96c2e2bdcf6272b57830f991620671ecfcda17453ab950fecedf03", "ja": "火薬だ！　火薬を使うんだよ。", "zh": "是火药！要用火药才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1005_p", "source_sha256": "4fe68da159555dbd8c4b882e74dfe451d85e99e1fb0ad43e68d772d6c5935daf", "ja": "えっ、火薬！？　あ、花火の演出って事か。\nそうだな、たまにはそういうのも……。", "zh": "诶，火药！？啊，是要用烟花来演出吗？\n也是，偶尔来点这种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "edeeecc32d8bbd03aa5990e2509049b1b361f5b999480455931d3da6eb0bf1f8", "ja": "違う違う！　そういう小さいヤツじゃなくて。\nもっとド迫力の爆発だよ。", "zh": "不是不是！不是那种小打小闹的东西。我要的是更有冲击力的大爆炸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "3e87e1d4947e113219288a181b8776668d479faa72305b11fa3d4051319856d0", "ja": "ほら、前にあたしがやった、ダイナマイト使った撮影、\nあっただろ？　あれくらいのやつ。", "zh": "你看，就是之前我用炸药拍摄的那次，不是有过吗？就要那种规模的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f4464de75e029dc3f62b442f90f6fe0f96fb61bc5d5971b906ce8e6b9fc8d62b", "ja": "あ、ああ……あったな……。\nって、いや、あれは無理だよ！　だいたいCGだし。", "zh": "啊，啊啊……是有那么回事……  \n不对，那种事可做不到啊！再说了，基本上都是CG。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "95cfab49c9bf5f88af85417edf4a54710245cdbcf338ec6074716c99a13db007", "ja": "あれくらいやらなきゃ、お客さんも満足しないって！\nアイドルの常識を、吹っ飛ばしてやるくらいにさ。", "zh": "不做到那种程度，观众可不会满足的！\n得拿出把偶像的常识彻底掀翻的气势才行啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "283f7bc2a027a3c7fd9d169af3db28834165ad52c96d4c6bd673b275cd4a065f", "ja": "せっかくの野外ライブなんだから、\nロックにいこうぜ！　な！？", "zh": "难得有机会办户外演唱会，就摇滚起来吧！对吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bf32c60e1874f704dcaac75eed9326b0d930e11a2784b474f32b3bc541d2aa4d", "ja": "う、うーん……やっぱりダメだ。\n予算が……いや、何より危ないからな。", "zh": "唔、嗯……还是不行。\n预算是个问题……不，最关键的是太危险了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1e25c4c234f489cc2992981b8fd8835bf74d663a703a5e97a07ca5f360741dff", "ja": "今回は花火で我慢してくれ。\nでもその分、ジュリアがハジケればいいんだよ！", "zh": "这次就先用烟花凑合一下吧。不过作为补偿，只要茱莉亚尽情绽放就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "2f1270a54a189529d4198bf654afc98847fb39c9ec5d6091b38f629f6e5e0e1d", "ja": "え、ハジケるって……。\nパフォーマンスで、ってことか？", "zh": "诶，要“绽放”……是指用表演来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1014_p", "source_sha256": "bc6558bddc3fb266db5b7d1e568fc222e36d01c7643569b38a5ceb3c71b23713", "ja": "そうだ！　お客さんはジュリアを見に来るんだからな。\nダイナマイト以上に、盛り上げてくれ。", "zh": "没错！观众就是来看茱莉亚的。给我比炸药还要卖力地把现场炒热起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1015_p", "source_sha256": "42530d7a4b4e1ee0f3392837006ae005ea17aacf0067cef7dc0ed4cdedeba95c", "ja": "ジュリアなら、できるだろ？", "zh": "茱莉亚的话，做得到吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "9f86223a073b8e47128877fb21d595c2b5368d254059e7635b386e85128950e6", "ja": "おっと……へへっ♪　そこまで言われちゃ、\nしょーがねえな……最高にハジケてみせるか。", "zh": "哎呀……嘿嘿♪ 都被你说到这个份上了，没办法……那就让我尽情爆发一回吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_050jul0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_050jul0273_1017_050jul", "source_sha256": "6af0004ed16c87542472150a427128dea58df5cf9a54f1bd168046024b53b357", "ja": "言っとくけど、一度火をつけたら止まらないぜ？\nダイナマイトも、あたしもさ♪", "zh": "先说好，一旦点燃了就停不下来哦？\n炸药是这样，我也是♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
